<title>SPAIN: TENNIS-NOVOTNA BEATS SELES IN MADRID OPEN FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NOVOTNA BEATS SELES IN MADRID OPEN FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the Madrid Open women's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat 1-Monica Seles (U.S.) 7-5 6-1</p>
